* Model: l110ae_momcaps_array_vp5_rf
* UMC RF vp5 array MOM capacitor
* Model coverage:
* nf: 10 - 40 (Even integer only)
* lf: (10 - 40) * 1e-06
* bm: 1 - 4
* ns: 3 - 6
* array: 1 - 4
* Frequency range: 1 MHz - 0.8 * resonance (maximum 16.0 GHz)
*
.lib tt 
.include './l110ae_momcaps_array_vp5_rf_v022.mdl'
.param
+d_cs5=1
.endl tt
*
.lib ff
.include './l110ae_momcaps_array_vp5_rf_v022.mdl'
.param
+d_cs5=0.85
.endl ff
*
.lib ss
.include './l110ae_momcaps_array_vp5_rf_v022.mdl'
.param
+d_cs5=1.15
.endl ss
